    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "From 1902 to 1906, the Walton company built automobiles in Neche, making the town a brief hub of early automotive manufacturing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neche%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Neche sits just one mile south of the U.S.–Canada border, with Gretna, Manitoba directly across the river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
